  "text": {
    "tagline": "Map any drum to any key. Restart not required.",
    "blurb": "Kit Manager 98 puts every drum on the right key, automatically. {count} kits: genre kits, classic machine kits and electromechanical kits, built from the sounds already on your computer and the library disc. Fast. Safe. Automatic.",
    "intro": [
      "Thank you for choosing Kit Manager 98 from Fennwick Systems, the makers of PlatterTune and MemPilot. Kit Manager 98 brings the speed and safety of Fennwick utilities to your drum programming.",
      "Each kit maps one drum to each key, with choke groups, velocity layers and round-robin variants. Kit Manager 98 needs no installation, changes no system files and never asks you to restart."
    ],
    "maker_note": [
      "We built Kit Manager 98 the way we build all Fennwick utilities: it must be fast, it must be safe, and it must never require a restart.",
      "Look for other titles in the Fennwick System Utilities Series at your software retailer: PlatterTune 98, MemPilot Plus and UnClutter Deluxe.",
      "The Kit Manager 98 Team, Fennwick Systems Corporation"
    ],
    "install": [
      "Insert the Kit Manager 98 CD-ROM. In the Library tab, the disc appears as KITMGR98.",
      "Open the GENRE, MACHINE or ELECTRO folder and double-click any kit to load it. Each key now plays a different drum.",
      "Kits need the v3 kit mode of the synthesizer. For support, see SUPPORT.TXT."
    ],
    "license": [
      "FENNWICK SYSTEMS CORPORATION SOFTWARE LICENSE AGREEMENT",
      "PLEASE READ THIS AGREEMENT BEFORE USING THE SOFTWARE. Using the software means that you accept these terms.",
      "1. LICENSE. You may use one copy of Kit Manager 98 on one computer at a time. Music you create with the kits is yours.",
      "2. UPGRADES. If this is an upgrade, you must own a qualifying Fennwick product.",
      "3. LIMITED WARRANTY. Fennwick warrants the CD-ROM against defects for 90 days. Fennwick's entire liability is replacement of the disc.",
      "4. YEAR 2000. Kit Manager 98 stores no dates and is Year 2000 ready.",
      "PlatterTune, MemPilot, UnClutter and Kit Manager are trademarks of Fennwick Systems Corporation."
    ],
    "copyright": "Copyright (C) 1998 Fennwick Systems Corporation. All rights reserved.",
    "files": {
      "SUPPORT.TXT": [
        "|KIT MANAGER 98 TECHNICAL SUPPORT",
        "|================================",
        "Before you call, please have your CD key (on the back of the jewel case) and your release number (Help, About) ready.",
        "|Phone:  (503) 555-0145, Monday to Friday, 7am-6pm Pacific",
        "|Fax-back documents: (503) 555-0146, request document 4410 for the Kit Manager FAQ",
        "|Web:    http://www.fennwicksys.com/support",
        "Q: The kits play the wrong drum on some keys.  A: Load the kit again from its folder. Kit Manager 98 never changes your other presets.",
        "Q: Do I need to restart?  A: No. Never."
      ],
      "CDKEY.TXT": [
